  "contentHtml": "<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><a href=\"https://cafe.daum.net/sedu22/424t/366\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"ke-link\">https://cafe.daum.net/sedu22/424t/366</a></p><div class=\"figure-open\" contenteditable=\"false\" data-ke-type=\"opengraph\" data-ke-align=\"alignCenter\" data-og-type=\"website\" data-og-title=\"Daum 카페\" data-og-description=\"\" data-og-host=\"cafe.daum.net\" data-og-source-url=\"https://cafe.daum.net/sedu22/424t/366\" data-og-url=\"https://cafe.daum.net/_c21_/bbs_read?grpid=1TaBA&amp;fldid=424t&amp;datanum=366\" data-og-image=\"//img1.kakaocdn.net/thumb/C200x200/?fname=https%3A%2F%2Ft1.daumcdn.net%2Fcafe_image%2Fcafe_meta_image_190529.png\"><a href=\"https://cafe.daum.net/sedu22/424t/366\" target=\"_blank\" data-source-url=\"https://cafe.daum.net/sedu22/424t/366\"><div class=\"og-image\"><img src=\"//img1.kakaocdn.net/thumb/C200x200/?fname=https%3A%2F%2Ft1.daumcdn.net%2Fcafe_image%2Fcafe_meta_image_190529.png\" alt=\"\" xxxxonerror=\"this.src=&quot;//img1.kakaocdn.net/thumb/C200x200/?fname=https%3A%2F%2Ft1.daumcdn.net%2Fcafe_image%2Fcafe_meta_image_190529.png&quot;\"></div><div class=\"og-text\"><p class=\"og-title\">Daum 카페</p><p class=\"og-desc\"></p><p class=\"og-host\">cafe.daum.net</p></div></a></div><p style=\"text-align: justify;\">&#160;<br>최근에 올린 글(위 링크)인&#160;<b>저희학교 과학의 달 행사 중</b> 에서<br>19번 섹션에서 했던 미션<br>&#160;<br><b><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">AI 툴을 이용한 그림 그리기 미션(미술실 미션)</span></b><br><b><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">주어진 그림과 비슷하게 그림 그리기</span></b><br>&#160;<br>&#160;</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/22967e07442df949b5c1519cd16186e025dc6185\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/22967e07442df949b5c1519cd16186e025dc6185\" data-origin-width=\"1024\" data-origin-height=\"1024\"></div><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><b>위 그림이 미션으로 주어진 그림입니다.</b><br>&#160;<br>&#160;<br>&#160;<br><b><span data-ke-size=\"size23\">“<span style=\"color: #FF6600;\">AI&#160;</span><span style=\"color: #FF6600;\">그림 그리기</span><span style=\"color: #FF6600;\">(</span><span style=\"color: #FF6600;\">미술실 미션</span><span style=\"color: #FF6600;\">)”에서</span></span></b><br><b><span style=\"color: #FF6600;\"><span data-ke-size=\"size23\">아이들이 제출한 작품들 입니다.</span></span></b><br>&#160;<br><b>학생들이 그린 그림 중에 가장 비슷하게 그린 그림들 입니다.</b></p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/6527ea3618da92f34b5da9a4472f9bb35c570bb2\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/6527ea3618da92f34b5da9a4472f9bb35c570bb2\" data-origin-width=\"1024\" data-origin-height=\"824\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/57e78f0a1d50989bd38a56542e830ba4efc93f31\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/57e78f0a1d50989bd38a56542e830ba4efc93f31\" data-origin-width=\"1079\" data-origin-height=\"1045\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/76aacc287650af4d5c01e3abea723225e997fcd3\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/76aacc287650af4d5c01e3abea723225e997fcd3\" data-origin-width=\"877\" data-origin-height=\"775\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/59a84cdc691b07899f22e862b551045d62a8d1bb\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/59a84cdc691b07899f22e862b551045d62a8d1bb\" data-origin-width=\"814\" data-origin-height=\"875\">